ISO-10303-21;
/* Fi007: OPEN_SHELL: spine EDGE_CURVE shared by two faces; small face is RECTANGULAR_TRIMMED_SURFACE UV [0,0.5]x[0,0.5] (area 0.25 mm²) — too small for rolling-ball fillet trace; rolling-ball exits face parametric domain before spine ends; fillet-leaks: kernel must truncate at face boundary and emit diagnostic */
